  "description": "It was late at night. The old-fashioned doorbell echoed through the run-down building, ringing on and on. Worried the noise might disturb the neighbors, Jee Heejin carefully opened the front door to see what was going on. \n\n *“Who is it…?” \n\n“Hey… long time no see.”*\n\nJee Hee-Jin and Jee Hyun-Woo, who once lived as step-siblings for five years after their parents’ remarriage, meet again after five years apart. Now a handsome medical student returning in triumph, Hyun-Woo approaches the drunken Hee-Jin and whispers that this time, they should become family not as siblings, but as husband and wife… and in this forbidden reunion, Hee-Jin is forced to make a life-altering choice.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
